cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in scientific work, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "AsteroidPipeline.jl"
abstract: >-
  An open-source Julia pipeline for asteroid search campaigns. It calibrates
  astrometry against Gaia DR3, detects moving objects, compares them with known
  asteroids and writes the report for the Minor Planet Center. It includes a
  terminal application in Python.
